v tabindex="0" class="x3psx0u x12xbjc7 x1c1uobl xrmvbpv xh8yej3 xquzyny xvc5jky x11t971q" data-tab="8"><div class="x141l45o x1h3r9g6 x1hx0egp x78zum5 x1q0g3np xl56j7k xscbp6u" tabindex="-1"><div class="x1n2onr6 x9f619 x1rg5ohu x1okw0bk x193iq5w x1tiyuxx x1nbhmlj x1iw51ew xde1mab xhslqc4 x2b8uid x1k43qru xrxyp3c xv0oops x1isl5vh xn8zj9a x148chh3"><span dir="auto" class="x140p0ai x1gufx9m x1s928wv xhkezso x1gmr53x x1cpjm7i x1fgarty x1943h6x x193iq5w xeuugli x13faqbe x1vvkbs x1lliihq x1fj9vlw xhslqc4 x1hx0egp x1pg5gke xjb2p0i xfjzk2p xl2ypbo x1ic7a3i" style="--x-fontSize: 12px; --x-lineHeight: 8.5313px; --x-8dd7yt: -0.0137em; --x-hxtmnb: 0.0137em;">2/12/2026</span></div></div><div class="x1n2onr6"><div tabindex="-1" class="" role="row"><div tabindex="-1" class="_amjv xscbp6u" data-id="true_593969781209@c.us_AC8EBD9169A08F7B9FB5074BB0F6E02B_out"><div class="x78zum5 xdt5ytf" data-virtualized="false"><div class=""><div class="message-out focusable-list-item _amjy _amjz _amjw x1klvx2g xahtqtb"><span class=""></span><div class="_amk4 false _amkd _amk5 false"><span aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tail-out" class="_amk7"><svg viewBox="0 0 8 13" height="13" width="8" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" class="" version="1.1" x="0px" y="0px" enable-background="new 0 0 8 13"><title>tail-out</title><path opacity="0.13" d="M5.188,1H0v11.193l6.467-8.625 C7.526,2.156,6.958,1,5.188,1z"></path><path fill="currentColor" d="M5.188,0H0v11.193l6.467-8.625C7.526,1.156,6.958,0,5.188,0z"></path></svg></span><div class="_amk6 _amlo false false"><span aria-label="Tú:"></span><div><div class="x9f619 x1hx0egp x1yrsyyn xizg8k xu9hqtb xwib8y2"><div class="copyable-text" data-pre-plain-text="[11:09 PM, 2/12/2026] 😼: "><div class="_akbu x6ikm8r x10wlt62"><span data-testid="selectable-text" dir="ltr" class="x1f6kntn xjb2p0i x8r4c90 xo1l8bm x1ic7a3i x12xpedu _ao3e _aupe copyable-text" style="min-height: 0px;"><span class="x1lliihq">La verdad no sé cómo empezar esta carta, pero te la escribo porque quiero que sepas que en este corto tiempo que hemos estado hablando me pareces una persona muy interesante y muy simpática. Me gusta tu forma de ser, eres muy linda y, aunque todavía tenemos que conocernos más, siento que conectamos muy bien.
</span><span class="">Espero que podamos seguir hablando y conociéndonos poco a poco. Solo quería que supieras lo que pienso de ti. Me alegra mucho haberte conocido y espero que esto sea el inicio de algo bonito.</span></span><span class=""><span class="x3nfvp2 xxymvpz xlshs6z xqtp20y xexx8yu x1uc92m x18d9i69 x181vq82 x12lo8hy x152skdk" aria-hidden="true"><span class="x1c4vz4f x2lah0s xn6xy2s"></span><span class="x1c4vz4f x2lah0s">11:09 PM</span></span></span></div></div><div class="x1n2onr6 x1n327nk x18mqm2i xhsvlbd x14z9mp xz62fqu x1wbi8v6"><div class="x1bvqhpb xx3o462 xuxw1ft x78zum5 x6s0dn4 x12lo8hy x152skdk"><span class="x1rg5ohu x16dsc37" dir="auto"><span class="x193iq5w xeuugli x13faqbe x1vvkbs xt0psk2 x1fj9vlw xhslqc4 x1hx0egp x1pg5gke xjb2p0i xo1l8bm xl2ypbo x1ic7a3i" style="--x-fontSize: 12px; --x-lineHeight: 8.5313px;">11:09 PM</span></span><div class="xhslqc4 x1rg5ohu x7phf20"><span aria-hidden="false" aria-label=" Leído " data-icon="msg-dblcheck" class="x1rv0e52"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 11" height="11" width="16" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" class="" fill="none"><title>msg-dblcheck</title><path d="M11.0714 0.652832C10.991 0.585124 10.8894 0.55127 10.7667 0.55127C10.6186 0.55127 10.4916 0.610514 10.3858 0.729004L4.19688 8.36523L1.79112 6.09277C1.7488 6.04622 1.69802 6.01025 1.63877 5.98486C1.57953 5.95947 1.51817 5.94678 1.45469 5.94678C1.32351 5.94678 1.20925 5.99544 1.11192 6.09277L0.800883 6.40381C0.707784 6.49268 0.661235 6.60482 0.661235 6.74023C0.661235 6.87565 0.707784 6.98991 0.800883 7.08301L3.79698 10.0791C3.94509 10.2145 4.11224 10.2822 4.29844 10.2822C4.40424 10.2822 4.5058 10.259 4.60313 10.2124C4.70046 10.1659 4.78086 10.1003 4.84434 10.0156L11.4903 1.59863C11.5623 1.5013 11.5982 1.40186 11.5982 1.30029C11.5982 1.14372 11.5348 1.01888 11.4078 0.925781L11.0714 0.652832ZM8.6212 8.32715C8.43077 8.20866 8.2488 8.09017 8.0753 7.97168C7.99489 7.89128 7.8891 7.85107 7.75791 7.85107C7.6098 7.85107 7.4892 7.90397 7.3961 8.00977L7.10411 8.33984C7